{"3219230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anomaly Clinic", "steam_appid": 3219230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/extras/2efaf1f0ce71ca86495d7d0582a22fef.avif?t=1780502063\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless British Clinic.<br>Observe your surroundings carefully to reach your appointment with Dr Ann O'Malley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for anomalies to reach your important appointment.<strong> </strong>  <br>If you find anomalies, enter the lift on the left.   <br>If you don't find anomalies, enter the lift on the right.   <br>  <br>  Anomaly Clinic is a short walking simulator inspired by British Hospitals, Exit 8, liminal spaces and back rooms.   <br>The game is only available in English, but if you understand the above description of the anomaly, you can probably play it all the way through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Spot anomalies&quot; game inspired by &quot;The Exit 8&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreating the ambiance of a British Hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of interesting British characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/extras/7bd388ba83524e46c3e18343acf1953b.avif?t=1780502063\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/extras/ce0dda47feba0e74e9e4cb93bbfc726a.avif?t=1780502063\" width